  "notes": "Instruction-tuned update to the original Gemma 2B and 7B; Google released no new pre-trained checkpoints for 1.1, and the model cards say the previous instruction-tuned weights stay available in the same repositories. Release date: the Gemma releases page gives April 5, 2024; the developer post announcing it is dated April 9, 2024 (kept as an alternative). The Hugging Face cards do not state a context length, so contextWindowTokens is left out. The 2B and 7B in the variant names are Google's size labels; the model cards give no parameter count, so parameters are left out."
